  "uncertain": [
    "Each image labels only one column of the 2x20 header; the unlabeled column's physical placement (odd pin N beside even pin N+1) is inferred from the printed numbering, and the full header needs the two images combined, which rule 11 does not allow in one connector. Image 2 does not show the board name."
  ],
  "notes": "The two images show the 40-pin header of the Luckfox Pico Zero (board name printed beside the header in image 1) from opposite sides: image 1 labels only the even pins 2-40, image 2 labels only the odd pins 1-39. Per rule 11 each image is transcribed separately as a 2x20 header with positions equal to the printed pin numbers; the column that the image does not label is kept as \"?\". Light-blue numbers beside the GPIO names are GPIO numbers, kept as functions. Legend categories omitted."
